# --- Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init) ---
# --- BMAD resolved config: installer-generated, bakes in personal identity ---
# --- BMAD working scratch: canonical outputs are promoted to docs/ ---
# --- Build output (grows with the app) ---
# --- Go ---
# --- Node / frontend ---
# --- OS / editor noise ---
# --- Personal / per-contributor (never shared) ---
# --- Wails ---
# Source of truth is the committed *.toml. Regenerate via the BMAD installer.
frontend/dist/*
# .gitkeep is the stable anchor for //go:embed all:frontend/dist so `go build
# ./...` compiles on a clean checkout without a frontend build. The real build
# output (index.html + hashed assets) is regenerated by `wails build` and stays
# ignored, so it never churns. Negation must follow the ignore — last match wins.
!frontend/dist/.gitkeep
frontend/node_modules/
# Root-anchored, like /e2e-sshd and /devharness below and for the same reason:
# a bare `go build .` drops the binary in the working directory. Unanchored it
# also matched every PATH COMPONENT named nocx, which silently swallowed
# frontend/bindings/github.com/shady2k/nocx/ — the generated bindings for our
# own module. They existed on the machine that generated them and nowhere else.
/nocx
node_modules/
# The other two cmd/ binaries, for the same reason as `nocx` above: a bare
# `go build ./cmd/e2e-sshd` drops its output in the working directory, and a
# 6 MB Mach-O in the repo root is one `git add -A` away from being committed.
# The e2e specs build these into a temp dir; these are what a hand-run leaves.
/e2e-sshd
/devharness
Thumbs.db
vendor/

# --- Playwright e2e ---
/node_modules/
# Not root-anchored: a run started from frontend/ writes frontend/test-results/,
# which `/test-results/` does not match — so the artefacts were untracked only by
# luck of where the suite happened to be invoked from.
test-results/
playwright-report/
/e2e/screenshots/
# bd worktree
.worktrees/nocx-3dk/
# bd worktree
.worktrees/nocx-q36/

# local harness state
.pi/

# Disposable home for e2e runs (playwright.config.ts home boundary, nocx-ti8w)
.e2e/

# Python bytecode from the AppImage packaging scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
